{"manifest":"m326357","canvas":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326370\/canvas\/default","page":"ᰜ ᰃᰩᰵ ᰍ ᰛᰪᰵ ᰑᰫᰰ ᰑᰨ ᰍᰪᰮ ᰟᰩᰮ ᰉᰬᰳ ᰉᰧ ᰎᰦ ᰼ ᰣᰦ ᰡᰦᰱ ᰀᰦ ᰀᰪᰵ ᰉᰩᰮ [1] ᰀᰫᰵ ᰜᰩᰱ ᰗᰪᰵ ᰋᰩᰮ ᰓᰫ ᰎᰴ ᰛᰬ ᰡᰧᰰᰶ ᰜᰪᰵ ᰕᰫᰰ ᰍᰩᰰ ᰡᰬᰰ ᰜ ᰼ [2] ᰠᰦᰵ ᰃᰬ ᰜᰦ ᰂᰤᰬᰰ ᰍᰨ ᰼ ᰛᰪᰵ ᰑᰫᰰ ᰑᰨ ᰊ ᰃᰥᰤᰧ ᰠ ᰠᰦᰭ ᰆᰧᰰᰶ ᰀᰦ [3] ᰊ ᰣᰤᰪ ᰕᰩᰳ ᰀᰪᰱ ᰎᰪᰰ ᰙᰨ ᰑᰦᰳ ᰊᰪᰵ ᰣᰤᰪᰮ ᰓᰦ ᰚᰨ ᰓᰦᰰ ᰊ ᰣᰤᰪ ᰕᰪᰮ ᰓᰪᰭ ᰡᰬᰰ [4] ᰜ ᰼ ᰛᰪᰵ ᰑᰫᰰ ᰑᰨ ᰣᰦ ᰚᰪ ᰛᰬ ᰕᰦᰭ ᰍᰩᰰ ᰍᰬ ᰚᰦᰮ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰜᰩᰰ ᰍᰪᰰ ᰠᰨ [5] ᰕᰤᰦᰵ ᰠ ᰜ ᰠᰪᰵ ᰉᰩᰮ ᰎᰴ ᰀᰦ ᰠᰨ ᰚᰪ ᰜᰪᰵ ᰡᰬᰯ ᰡᰬᰰ ᰜ [6] ᰠᰪᰵ ᰉᰩᰮ ᰛᰬ ᰜᰩᰳ ᰜᰪᰵ ᰛᰤᰫ ᰛᰤᰦᰮ ᰜ ᰕᰦᰳ ᰜᰪᰵ ᰅᰦᰰ ᰉᰧ ᰡᰬᰰ ᰜ ᰼ [7] ᰛᰪᰵ ᰑᰪᰰ ᰑᰨ ᰊ ᰃᰥᰤᰧ ᰠ ᰠᰦᰭ ᰆᰧᰰᰶ ᰀᰦ ᰣᰤᰦ ᰠ ᰠᰪᰵ ᰉᰩᰮ ᰛᰬ [8] ᰊ ᰣᰤᰪ ᰕᰩᰳ ᰀᰪᰱ ᰎᰪᰰ ᰕ ᰙᰨ ᰍ ᰚᰦᰵ ᰜ ᰃᰨ ᰍᰪᰰ ᰓᰪᰭ ᰜᰪᰵ ᰠᰩᰳ ᰊᰪᰵ ᰛᰬ ᰚᰫ [9] ᰓᰦᰰ ᰠᰦᰭ ᰌᰩᰭ ᰜᰪᰵ ᰝᰥᰤᰩᰱ ᰃᰴ ᰜ ᰕ ᰎᰩᰰ ᰠ ᰕ ᰉᰧᰰᰶ ᰍᰬ ᰚᰦᰮ [10] ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰣᰦ ᰜᰩᰵ ᰍ ᰡᰧᰶ ᰠ ᰕ ᰉᰧᰰᰶ ᰍᰬ ᰚᰦᰮ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰣᰨ ᰜᰨ ᰚᰨ ᰜᰧ [11] ᰓᰦᰰ ᰝᰥᰤᰩᰱ ᰚᰦᰮ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰣᰲᰶ ᰛᰬᰰ ᰀᰦ ᰣᰲᰶ ᰑᰨ ᰍᰪᰮ ᰟᰩᰮ ᰉᰬᰳ ᰉᰧ ᰚᰦᰮ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ [12] ᰣᰦ ᰡᰦᰱ ᰀᰦ ᰠ ᰜᰤᰦᰵ ᰎᰩᰳ ᰠᰦᰮ ᰉᰧ ᰅᰪᰵ ᰛᰬ ᰣᰦ ᰡᰦᰱ ᰠ ᰣᰦᰵ [13] ᰀᰦ ᰄᰫ [14] ᰍᰩᰰ ᰍᰬ ᰚᰦᰮ ᰕ ᰣᰨ [15] ᰠ ᰜᰤᰦᰵ ᰎᰩᰳ ᰛᰬ ᰊ ᰣᰤᰪ ᰕᰩᰳ ᰀᰪᰱ ᰎᰪᰰ ᰙᰨ ᰑᰦᰳ ᰊᰪᰵ [16] ᰣᰤᰪᰮ ᰓᰦ ᰚᰩᰵ ᰠᰦᰭ ᰆᰧᰵᰶ ᰜᰪᰵ ᰣᰦ ᰚᰪ ᰕᰪᰮ ᰓᰪᰭ ᰡᰬᰰ ᰜ ᰜᰨᰰ ᰍᰪᰰ [17] ᰣᰦ ᰚᰪ ᰛᰬ ᰕᰦᰭ ᰍᰩᰰ ᰍᰬ ᰚᰦᰮ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰣᰬᰭ ᰀ ᰜᰨᰰ ᰍᰪᰰ ᰠᰨ ᰕᰤᰦᰵ ᰠ ᰜ ᰠᰨ [18] ᰚᰪ ᰜᰪᰵ ᰠ ᰜᰤᰦᰵ ᰎᰩᰳ ᰀᰦ ᰠᰨ ᰚᰪ ᰡᰬᰯ ᰜᰪᰵ ᰠ ᰠ ᰜᰤᰦᰵ [19] ᰚᰩᰳ ᰛᰬ ᰣᰦ ᰀᰫᰵ ᰣᰦ ᰉᰩᰮ ᰣᰦ ᰓᰨᰲ ᰣᰦ ᰎᰩᰳ ᰠ ᰕᰦᰳ ᰜᰪᰵ ᰅᰦᰰ ᰉᰧ [20] ᰡᰬᰰ ᰜ ᰼ ᰀ ᰣᰲᰶ ᰑᰨ ᰊ ᰃᰥᰤᰧᰶ ᰛᰬ ᰠ ᰠᰦᰭ ᰆᰧᰰᰶ ᰀᰦ ᰠ ᰜᰤᰦᰵ ᰎᰩᰳ [21] ᰛᰬ ᰊ ᰣᰤᰪ ᰕᰩᰳ ᰀᰪᰱ ᰎᰪᰰ ᰕ ᰙᰨ ᰍ ᰜᰤᰦᰵ ᰀᰦ ᰄᰫ ᰅᰪᰵ ᰀᰦ ᰃᰨ ᰍᰪᰰ [22] ᰓᰪᰭ ᰜᰪᰵ ᰠᰩᰳ ᰑᰦᰳ ᰊᰪᰵ ᰛᰬ ᰣᰬ ᰚᰨ ᰓᰦᰰ ᰣᰦ ᰚᰪ ᰠ ᰑᰪᰵ ᰛᰬᰮ ᰜᰩᰳ [23] ᰜᰪᰵ ᰌᰪᰮ ᰌᰩᰵ ᰠ ᰊᰤᰬᰳ ᰛᰤᰫ ᰊᰤᰬᰳ ᰕᰦᰳ ᰜᰪᰵ ᰌᰤᰦᰮ ᰓᰧ ᰓᰦᰰ ᰜᰩᰳ [24] ᰜᰪᰵ ᰡᰧᰶ ᰡᰩᰭ ᰃᰩᰵ ᰜ ᰜᰩᰳ ᰜᰪᰵ ᰜᰫᰭ ᰠ [25] ᰕ ᰉᰧᰰᰶ ᰍᰬ ᰼ ᰣᰲᰶ ᰍᰪᰰ ᰀ ᰣᰲᰶ ᰑᰨ ᰊ ᰃᰥᰤᰧᰶ ᰠ ᰠᰦᰭ ᰆᰧᰰᰶ ᰀᰦ [26] ᰣᰤᰫᰭ ᰎᰥᰤᰩᰭ ᰕᰦᰳ ᰓᰦᰮ ᰓᰦ ᰣᰦ ᰀ ᰃᰥᰪᰮ ᰕᰪᰵ ᰛᰬ ᰕ ᰛᰤᰫ ᰍᰬ ᰼ [27] ᰣᰲᰶ ᰛᰤᰬᰰ ᰀ ᰣᰲᰶ ᰑᰨ ᰊ ᰃᰥᰤᰧᰶ ᰛᰬ ᰣᰤᰫᰭ ᰎᰥᰤᰩᰭ ᰙᰫᰭ ᰓᰦᰮ ᰚᰨᰵ ᰜ [28] ᰕ ᰠᰩᰵ ᰍᰪᰮ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰣᰦ ᰀ ᰃᰥᰪᰮ ᰕᰪᰵ ᰛᰬ ᰋᰦᰮ ᰉᰩᰳ ᰃᰪᰮ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ [29] ᰣᰦ ᰀ ᰞᰩᰭ ᰀᰪᰵ ᰛᰬ ᰋᰨ ᰢᰪᰵ ᰕ ᰃᰦᰰ ᰍᰪᰮ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰣᰦ ᰜᰩᰵ [30] ᰎᰪᰰ ᰌᰧ ᰛᰬ ᰠᰩᰳ ᰜᰤᰬᰯ ᰑᰦᰳ ᰊᰬ ᰚᰦᰮ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰓᰨ ᰠ ᰕ ᰉᰧᰰᰶ ᰍᰬ [31] ᰚᰦᰮ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰎ ᰍᰨ ᰍᰪᰰ ᰜᰧ ᰓᰦ ᰝᰩ ᰌᰨ ᰠ ᰛᰧᰵᰶ ᰎᰴ ᰛᰬ [32] ᰝᰶ ᰌᰨ ᰀᰦ ᰟᰫᰵ ᰅᰪᰵ ᰜᰦᰳ ᰎᰦ ᰚᰨ ᰜᰧ ᰡᰬᰰ ᰜ ᰀᰪᰲ ᰋᰦᰭ [33] ᰢᰨᰭ ᰛᰬ ᰍᰪᰰ ᰡᰪ ᰓᰦ ᰟᰫᰵ ᰅᰪᰵ ᰀᰦ ᰜ ᰉᰦᰭ ᰀ ᰃᰤᰦᰱ [34] ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰎ ᰍᰨ ᰍᰪᰰ ᰣᰦ ᰜᰩᰰ ᰓᰫ ᰟᰤᰬᰳ ᰣᰩᰵ ᰛᰬ ᰃᰪᰰ ᰍ ᰌᰪᰰ ᰀᰦ [35] ᰟᰫᰵ ᰅᰪᰵ ᰜᰦᰳ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰣᰨᰮ ᰕᰦ ᰍᰧ ᰎᰬ ᰕᰬ ᰝᰫᰵ ᰝᰥᰧᰶ ᰼ [36] ᰀᰤᰩᰰ ᰌᰤᰧᰳᰶ ᰊ ᰕ ᰚᰰᰶ ᰍᰪᰵ ᰠ ᰌᰧᰭᰶ ᰎᰫ ᰛᰬ ᰊ ᰌᰨ ᰀᰦ ᰟᰫᰵ [37] ᰅᰪᰵ ᰜᰦᰳ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰀᰦ ᰌᰨ ᰀᰦ ᰟᰫᰵ ᰅᰪᰵ ᰠ ᰌᰧᰭᰶ ᰎ ᰛᰬ ᰙᰩᰭ [38] ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰕᰦ ᰚᰪᰰ ᰍᰪᰵ ᰙᰨ ᰙᰫᰭ ᰑᰦᰳ ᰊᰪᰵ ᰠ ᰠᰦᰭ ᰌᰩᰭ ᰛᰬ [39] ᰊ ᰌᰨ ᰀᰦ ᰟᰫᰵ ᰅᰪᰵ ᰜᰦᰳ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰜᰧᰰᰶ ᰕ ᰚᰪᰰ ᰍᰪᰵ ᰠ [40] ᰛᰧᰵᰶ ᰛᰬ ᰊ ᰌᰨ ᰀᰦ ᰟᰫᰵ ᰅᰪᰵ ᰜᰦᰳ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰎ ᰍᰨ ᰝᰩ [41] ᰡᰨ ᰠ ᰕ ᰊᰪᰰ ᰍ ᰃᰩᰵ ᰌᰧᰭᰶ ᰎᰫ ᰠ ᰜ ᰚᰨ ᰜ ᰠᰩᰵ [42] ᰊ ᰌᰨ ᰀᰦ ᰟᰫᰵ ᰅᰪᰵ ᰜᰦᰳ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰣᰨ ᰜᰨ ᰚᰨ ᰡᰪ ᰡᰬᰰ [43] ᰜ ᰼ ᰎ ᰍᰨ ᰍᰪᰰ ᰜᰧ ᰓᰦ ᰝᰩ ᰌᰨ ᰀᰦ ᰠᰦᰭ ᰆᰧᰰᰶ ᰊᰧ ᰕᰫ [44] ᰀᰦᰳ ᰊ ᰉᰧ ᰢᰪᰵ ᰣᰤᰪᰮ ᰓᰦ ᰚᰨ ᰜᰧ ᰡᰬᰰ ᰜ ᰼ ᰀᰪᰲ ᰋᰦᰭ ᰢᰨᰭ [45] ᰛᰬ ᰍᰪᰰ ᰜᰧ ᰓᰦ ᰠᰦᰭ ᰆᰧᰰᰶ ᰊᰧ ᰢᰪᰵ ᰀᰦ ᰜ ᰉᰦᰭ ᰀ ᰃᰤᰦᰱ [46] ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰓᰫ ᰍᰩᰰ ᰍᰪᰵ ᰛᰬ ᰜᰩᰳ ᰜᰪᰵ ᰝᰥᰤᰪᰱ ᰜᰤᰬᰯ ᰜ ᰃᰩᰵ ᰍ ᰠᰦᰭ [47] ᰆᰧᰰᰶ ᰛᰬ ᰊᰧ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰌᰤᰬᰭ ᰍᰩᰰ ᰍᰪᰵ ᰛᰬ ᰡᰫᰭ ᰜᰤᰬᰯ ᰜ ᰃᰨᰵ ᰠᰦᰭ [48] ᰆᰧᰰᰶ ᰊᰧ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰑᰤᰬᰰ ᰎᰪᰰ ᰈᰪᰮ ᰜᰫᰭ ᰜᰪᰵ ᰃᰤᰩ ᰂᰦᰵ ᰜᰪᰵ [49] ᰓᰤᰬ ᰓᰥᰤᰬᰳ ᰍᰩᰰ ᰍᰪᰵ ᰛᰬ ᰡᰩᰮ ᰊᰪᰰ ᰜ ᰙᰫᰭ ᰜᰤᰬᰯ ᰜ ᰃᰩᰵ ᰍ ᰠᰦᰭ [50] ᰆᰧᰰᰶ ᰊᰧ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰠ ᰛᰬ ᰕᰦᰳ ᰡᰪᰮ ᰓᰫ ᰎᰩᰵ ᰕᰦᰳ ᰜᰤᰬᰯ [51] ᰜ ᰃᰩᰵ ᰠᰦᰭ ᰆᰧᰰᰶ ᰊᰧ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰜ ᰚᰨ ᰜ ᰠᰩᰵ ᰛᰬ ᰌᰤᰪᰰ [52] ","annotations":[{"manifest":"m326357","canvas":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326370\/canvas\/default","mode":"line","line":"1","annotation":{"id":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326370\/canvas\/default\/annotation\/r1","type":"Annotation","motivation":"supplementing","body":{"text":"ᰜ ᰃᰩᰵ ᰍ ᰛᰪᰵ ᰑᰫᰰ ᰑᰨ ᰍᰪᰮ ᰟᰩᰮ ᰉᰬᰳ ᰉᰧ ᰎᰦ ᰼ ᰣᰦ ᰡᰦᰱ ᰀᰦ ᰀᰪᰵ ᰉᰩᰮ","type":"TextualBody"},"target":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326370\/canvas\/default#xywh=358,361,2436,136"}},{"manifest":"m326357","canvas":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326370\/canvas\/default","mode":"line","line":"2","annotation":{"id":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326370\/canvas\/default\/annotation\/r2","type":"Annotation","motivation":"supplementing","body":{"text":"ᰀᰫᰵ ᰜᰩᰱ ᰗᰪᰵ ᰋᰩᰮ ᰓᰫ ᰎᰴ ᰛᰬ ᰡᰧᰰᰶ ᰜᰪᰵ ᰕᰫᰰ ᰍᰩᰰ ᰡᰬᰰ ᰜ ᰼","type":"TextualBody"},"target":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326370\/canvas\/default#xywh=358,507,2340,128"}},{"manifest":"m326357","canvas":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326370\/canvas\/default","mode":"line","line":"3","annotation":{"id":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326370\/canvas\/default\/annotation\/r3","type":"Annotation","motivation":"supplementing","body":{"text":"ᰠᰦᰵ ᰃᰬ ᰜᰦ ᰂᰤᰬᰰ ᰍᰨ ᰼ ᰛᰪᰵ ᰑᰫᰰ ᰑᰨ ᰊ ᰃᰥᰤᰧ ᰠ ᰠᰦᰭ ᰆᰧᰰᰶ ᰀᰦ","type":"TextualBody"},"target":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326370\/canvas\/default#xywh=382,653,2394,136"}},{"manifest":"m326357","canvas":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326370\/canvas\/default","mode":"line","line":"4","annotation":{"id":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326370\/canvas\/default\/annotation\/r4","type":"Annotation","motivation":"supplementing","body":{"text":"ᰊ ᰣᰤᰪ ᰕᰩᰳ ᰀᰪᰱ ᰎᰪᰰ ᰙᰨ ᰑᰦᰳ ᰊᰪᰵ ᰣᰤᰪᰮ ᰓᰦ ᰚᰨ ᰓᰦᰰ ᰊ ᰣᰤᰪ ᰕᰪᰮ ᰓᰪᰭ ᰡᰬᰰ","type":"TextualBody"},"target":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326370\/canvas\/default#xywh=352,774,2418,152"}},{"manifest":"m326357","canvas":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326370\/canvas\/default","mode":"line","line":"5","annotation":{"id":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326370\/canvas\/default\/annotation\/r5","type":"Annotation","motivation":"supplementing","body":{"text":"ᰜ ᰼ ᰛᰪᰵ ᰑᰫᰰ ᰑᰨ ᰣᰦ ᰚᰪ ᰛᰬ ᰕᰦᰭ ᰍᰩᰰ ᰍᰬ ᰚᰦᰮ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰜᰩᰰ ᰍᰪᰰ ᰠᰨ","type":"TextualBody"},"target":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326370\/canvas\/default#xywh=376,916,2400,141"}},{"manifest":"m326357","canvas":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326370\/canvas\/default","mode":"line","line":"6","annotation":{"id":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326370\/canvas\/default\/annotation\/r6","type":"Annotation","mo